==German==

===Etymology===
{{prefix|ver|lassen|lang=de}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/fɛɐ̯ˈlasn̩/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-verlassen.ogg|audio}}

===Verb===
{{infl|de|verb}}

# to [[leave]], to [[abandon]], to [[depart]]
#: ''Die Ratten verlassen das sinkende Schiff.'' - The rats are abandoning the sinking ship.
# (''sich verlassen auf'') to [[trust]]
#:''Ich verlasse mich darauf, dass du morgen da bist.'' - I trust you that you will be there tomorrow.

